# Keep deploys lean. Do not omit workspace package.json roots (breaks bun.lock).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/out
retired/backend/server
retired/backend/dist
webmail
**/.wrangler
**/.vinext
**/*.p8
.env*
!.env.example
# Native app source is large; keep package.json for workspace resolution.
apps/native-calendar/**
!apps/native-calendar/package.json
apps/native-mail/**
!apps/native-mail/package.json
packages/native-core/**
!packages/native-core/package.json
!packages/native-core/expo-apps.json
apps/gatus/**
!apps/gatus/package.json
apps/stalwart/**
!apps/stalwart/package.json
apps/notifications/**
